      "teaser": "Furry trader pictures  (fursonas), supports a whopping 32 modded traders !",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2671.jpg",
      "downloads": 16346,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3>Replaces all default trader pictures (including Lightkeeper and BTR driver), supports most updated traders.</h3>\n<h3>For mod to work: run ‘Rename-Cached_Images.bat’ in mod folder and enter 1 to update trader pictures. Refer to installation section for instructions.</h3>\n<h3><strong>Please be my friend fr fr, I am kinda lonely Telegram @SashaSwan23</strong></h3>\n<p>Install <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1508-kaeno-traderscrolling/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kaeno TraderScrolling</a> if you have modded traders.</p>\n<p>I made this to make new friends! Please leave a message.</p>\n<p>Modded traders supported (Clickable links. None of them are necessary for mod to work):</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1717-lotus/#versions\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Lotus  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1183-aes-ultimate-questing-traders/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Anastasia, Evelyn and Svetlana</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1764-epic-s-all-in-one/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Badger</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2185-mopp-magyeong-s-outfit-plus-pack/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Intermediator</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/886-hephaestus/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hephaestus</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2748-tark-tactical-arms-racketeer-kaliber/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Kaliber</a> (Conflicts with Tony, bug made by another mod developer)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1500-saria-shop/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Saria</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2649-croupier-random-loadouts-flea-quicksell/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Croupier</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2013-gambler-trader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Gambler</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2888-yetanothertradermod/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tony</a> (Conflicts with Kaliber, bug made by another mod developer)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2127-all-ammo-trader-updated-by-flatcult/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">VAFELZ</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1022-gunsmith/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Gunsmith  </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1944-legs-the-trader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Legs</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/546-priscilu-the-trader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">PrisciluOrigins</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2270-priscilu-the-trader-timmygg-edition/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Priscilu TimmyGG versio</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1869-beta-scorpion/#tab_34958049eb45970369f3c2282cd124408f392a83\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Scorpion</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1410-artem/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Artem</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1412-painter/#tab_d1673ad396f531b272d79531b9b8d97856770b28\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Painter</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2556-unknown-survivor/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Survivor</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2400-the-cat-burglar/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">The Cat Burglar</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1622-guiding-light-95/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Guiding Light + Evil Light   </a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2726-scav-cat-trader-mod-refurred/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">SCAV CAT</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1817-harryhideout/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Harry Hideout</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/558-bluehead-s-aio-trader/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AIO trader</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1799-yuri-the-rat/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Yuri the Rat</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2393-coyote-trader-3-10-x-update/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Coyote</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/CJ-SPT/Skills-Extended/releases\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Scholars Society (Skills Extended)</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1673-raid-overhaul/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Requisitions Office (Raid Overhaul)</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2689-volkov-trader/#overview\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Volkov</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2897-chef-boyardyev/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Chef Boyardyev</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Haven’t tested every trader because some haven’t been updated and might break when they are updated. <strong>If something’s wrong - let me know.</strong></p>\n<p>You can suggest new traders</p>\n<p>Has ~100mb folder of additional pictures for your entertainment,</p>\n<p>includes selected funny fails and some original pictures for you to use in AI gen</p>\n<p>(Doesn’t impact performance, you can delete “Additional content”)</p>\n\n<p>Need a new cpu to actually play tarkov so any help towards that goal would be very appreciated </p>\n</div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation/Uninstall</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>**Installation:</p>\n<p>0. Make sure tarkov and tarkov server are closed before installation.</p>\n<p>1. Unzip ‘user’ folder into your SPT directory</p>\n<p>2. Go to \\user\\mods\\New furry trader pictures by SashaSwan</p>\n<p>3. Run ‘Rename-Cached_Images.bat’ and enter 1. After a few seconds it’s done, you can close the script and play the game.</p>\n<p><strong>If pictures won’t show up in game:</strong></p>\n<p>Make sure you don’t have any other picture replacers installed.</p>\n<p>1. Clear cache in battlestate games launcher settings</p>\n<p>2. Run ‘Rename-Cached_Images.bat’ and enter 2 to restore trader pictures. Now enter 1 to update pictures.</p>\n<p>Now it should work when you start your Tarkov server again</p>\n<p><strong>To uninstall:</strong></p>\n<p>1. Run ‘Rename-Cached_Images.bat’ and enter 2. Now you can delete the mod folder.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Update mod</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Delete old mod: user\\mods\\New furry trader pictures by SashaSwan.</p>\n<p>Extract new mod to SPT directory.</p>\n<p>In ‘user\\mods\\New furry trader pictures by SashaSwan’<br />\nrun ‘Rename-Cached_Images.bat’ and enter 2 to restore trader pictures. Now enter 1 to update pictures (restart tarkov server).</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">How to add your picture</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>To replace any of my pictures with your own follow these steps:</p>\n<p>1. Find jpg (must be jpg) image, preferably 1024x1024 pixels.<br />\n2. Go to \\New furry trader pictures by SashaSwan\\res</p>\n<p>3. Replace your picture with the trader you want to change. You should rename it as original image, otherwise it won’t work.</p>\n<p>4. Run ‘Rename-Cached_Images.bat’ and enter 2 to restore trader pictures. Now enter 1 to update pictures. Don’t forget to restart the server.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>All pictures were made by me using comfy ui + NovaFurry XL (Illustrious V.2) model. Some pictures in ‘Additional content/Source Images’ should contain prompts and workflow.</p>\n<p>CivitAI link for my other AI pictures <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://civitai.com/user/AlexanderSwan/images\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://civitai.com/user/AlexanderSwan/images</a></p>\n<p>Idea from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/1276-ai-furry-trader-icons/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">AI Furry Trader Icons</a> by svbtext</p>\n<p>Based on code from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/163-alternative-trader-pics/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">alternative traders pics</a> by jbs4bmx and <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2048-silly-cat-trader-icons/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Silly Cat Trader Icons</a> by AmTurtle</p></div></div></div>\n",
